  objects:
    count: 2-4 monochromatic 4-connected foreground objects, each a distinct color (may repeat across groups)
    distinct_top_rows: every object has a unique top bbox row
    shape: irregular blobs with bbox fill ratio 0.79-1.0; may contain bg-colored holes
