    Grid = Band_0 | Sep | Band_1 | Sep | ... | Band_{n-1}
    Bands span full width (leftmost starts col 0, rightmost ends at last col)
    Separators are exactly 1 column wide, filled entirely with bg
  bands:
    count: 3 [observed], solver requires >=2
    width: 1-3 cols each; total band cols = grid_cols - (count-1)
    content: each cell is either the band's fg color or bg
